  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support to the Legal and Human Rights Centre (LHRC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the Legal and Human Rights Centre (LHRC) for three years covering the strategy 2025-2030. The Embassy supports LHRC&apos;s core objectives that includes to improve legal and policy environment in Tanzania; to reduce incidences of violence and discrimination against women, children and people with disability (PWDs); enhance accountability of duty bearers (Tanzania authorities) to address citizens&apos; needs and concerns. 

The support also aims at enhancing efficiency, effectiveness and sustainability of LHRC, as a human rights institution.</narrative>
  </description>
